<section id="building-explore" class="building-toolbar" aria-labelledby="building-explore-heading"><h2 id="building-explore-heading">Explore architecture</h2><p class="bd-help">Filter the floor, element type or name. Other source packages and construction steps remain available below.</p><div class="bd-primary-filters"><label>Floor / scope<select id="level-select"><option value="all">Whole building</option><option value="foundation">Foundation</option><!-- FLOOR_OPTIONS --></select></label><label>Element type<select id="kind-select"><option value="all">All types</option></select></label><label class="search-label">Find element / source value<input id="model-search" type="search" placeholder="Window, door, wall, room…"></label></div><details class="bd-secondary-controls"><summary>Other source packages &amp; construction steps</summary><div class="bd-filter-grid"><label>View package<select id="package-select"><option value="architecture">Architecture · rooms &amp; envelope</option><option value="building">Building overview</option><option value="structure">Concrete structure</option><option value="envelope">Walls &amp; openings</option><option value="reinforcement">Reinforcement</option><option value="bands">Sill &amp; lintel studies</option><option value="all">All source studies</option></select></label><label>Construction step<select id="stage-select"><option value="all">Explore freely</option></select></label></div></details><button type="button" id="reset-building-filters">Reset architecture filters</button><p role="status" aria-live="polite"><strong id="component-count">Loading elements…</strong><span id="building-filter-status">Tap an element for linked dimensions and source evidence.</span></p></section>
